    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a83e9cb529773efeab937bb6b679cbb7.avif?t=1753867058\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>Return to your grandpa\u2019s farm and restore it to its former glory in <strong>Chiklet's Human Products</strong> that uniquely blends farming, automation, and survival. Begin your journey on a wild, overgrown island with only a few coins and the guidance of your grandpa\u2019s old buddy, Hacklet. As you explore, capture and harvest wild humans of all rarities, transforming them into a myriad of bizarre recipes that challenge conventional farming. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your grandpa\u2019s old friends\u2019 shops and defy the oppressive rule of a new king who values human life above all else. But be warned\u2014the islands are rife with danger. Ferocious monsters lurk around every corner, on both land and water, ready to strike without hesitation. Equip yourself with a formidable arsenal of cutting-edge tools and weapons to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the satirical edge of George Orwell\u2019s <i>Animal Farm</i>, Chiklet's Human Products immerses you in a conflicted world where the worth of human life is reimagined with a darkly humorous twist. Expand your farm by manually hunting and gathering resources, then gradually automate your operations for maximum profit. Craft and sell an array of exotic recipes\u2014from Human Tikka Masala to Thigh Burgers and Finger Pizza\u2014while carefully balancing your farm\u2019s reputation against the risk of notoriety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/c13697fab9dbb7147c89a6a220297d76.avif?t=1753867058\" width=422 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand your farm to achieve unparalleled profits. Transition from manual labor to automated processes, and master the art of crafting unique human-based recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a1bfc9da8481dc0fc3c92f41e44fb640.avif?t=1753867058\" width=426 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter not only feeble, wild humans but also formidable monsters as you venture into uncharted territories. Hone your combat skills and strategically upgrade your arsenal to overcome these threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/5a78faaf5916c3ee15f34d861bd9906c.avif?t=1753867058\" width=417 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of characters who offer diverse quests\u2014from treasure hunts to the capture of rare humans, monsters, and fish. Equip your shovel, fishing rod, and weapons, and embark on daring adventures across the wildest islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you revive your grandpa\u2019s legacy and defy the tyranny of a king obsessed with human life, or will the challenges of the islands prove too daunting? The choice is yours in this quirky, darkly humorous farming adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a83e9cb529773efeab937bb6b679cbb7.avif?t=1753867058\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>Return to your grandpa\u2019s farm and restore it to its former glory in <strong>Chiklet's Human Products</strong> that uniquely blends farming, automation, and survival. Begin your journey on a wild, overgrown island with only a few coins and the guidance of your grandpa\u2019s old buddy, Hacklet. As you explore, capture and harvest wild humans of all rarities, transforming them into a myriad of bizarre recipes that challenge conventional farming. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/319d6e01d1f33a70002bef8c7e365152.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild your grandpa\u2019s old friends\u2019 shops and defy the oppressive rule of a new king who values human life above all else. But be warned\u2014the islands are rife with danger. Ferocious monsters lurk around every corner, on both land and water, ready to strike without hesitation. Equip yourself with a formidable arsenal of cutting-edge tools and weapons to survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/116f66d955a25204bdb8e027172ed8e8.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the satirical edge of George Orwell\u2019s <i>Animal Farm</i>, Chiklet's Human Products immerses you in a conflicted world where the worth of human life is reimagined with a darkly humorous twist. Expand your farm by manually hunting and gathering resources, then gradually automate your operations for maximum profit. Craft and sell an array of exotic recipes\u2014from Human Tikka Masala to Thigh Burgers and Finger Pizza\u2014while carefully balancing your farm\u2019s reputation against the risk of notoriety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/c13697fab9dbb7147c89a6a220297d76.avif?t=1753867058\" width=422 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/44a50ebc00c950b814c60228352446a9.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade, and expand your farm to achieve unparalleled profits. Transition from manual labor to automated processes, and master the art of crafting unique human-based recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/a1bfc9da8481dc0fc3c92f41e44fb640.avif?t=1753867058\" width=426 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/07caf41dee73818003d3ea6f40793ec3.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter not only feeble, wild humans but also formidable monsters as you venture into uncharted territories. Hone your combat skills and strategically upgrade your arsenal to overcome these threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/5a78faaf5916c3ee15f34d861bd9906c.avif?t=1753867058\" width=417 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.poster.avif?t=1753867058\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.webm?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643250/extras/280a71cbcf9220cd127be4bebbdf94ad.mp4?t=1753867058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of characters who offer diverse quests\u2014from treasure hunts to the capture of rare humans, monsters, and fish. Equip your shovel, fishing rod, and weapons, and embark on daring adventures across the wildest islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you revive your grandpa\u2019s legacy and defy the tyranny of a king obsessed with human life, or will the challenges of the islands prove too daunting? The choice is yours in this quirky, darkly humorous farming adventure!</p>",
